[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567943995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100837#issuecomment-2567943995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100837","id":2567943995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZD7c7","user":{"login":"Houtamelo","id":88971943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4OTcxOTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88971943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Houtamelo","html_url":"https://github.com/Houtamelo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Houtamelo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Houtamelo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Houtamelo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Houtamelo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Houtamelo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Houtamelo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Houtamelo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Houtamelo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Houtamelo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-02T15:24:55Z","updated_at":"2025-01-02T15:24:55Z","body":"More info:\n\nIf your field is a type that can't normally be exported (like a custom class), then `_Get`/`_Set` does work normally too.\n\nExample:\n\n```csharp\nclass PlayerData {\n    string name;\n    int score;\n}\n\npublic partial class MyGodotObject: Node {\n    PlayerData player_data;\n}\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567943995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5805611055","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100837#issuecomment-5805611055","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100837","id":5805611055,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWgqYLw","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T01:07:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T01:07:06Z","body":"The Godot C# integration registers those unexported fields as script variables. If I remember correctly, this behavior matches GDScript. When the `_GetPropertyList` method tries to register a property with the same name, we should probably print an error. However, in 4.8 you can workaround this by simply opting out of registering these fields like this:\n\n```csharp\n\t[IgnoreMember]\n\tShapeType ty = ShapeType.Sphere;\n\t[IgnoreMember]\n\tStringName? string_name;\n\t[IgnoreMember]\n\tResource? res;\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5805611055/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]